    "Everything Spacebar removes shows up here, so you can put it back while it's in the Trash." : {

    },
    "Everything else: system-wide app support in /Library, temporary files and logs, Spotlight's index, snapshots, and folders Spacebar can't read without Full Disk Access." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles andere: systemweiter App-Support in /Library, temporäre Dateien und Protokolle, der Spotlight-Index, Snapshots und Ordner, die Spacebar ohne Festplattenvollzugriff nicht lesen kann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todo lo demás: soporte de apps para todo el sistema en /Library, archivos temporales y registros, el índice de Spotlight, instantáneas y carpetas que Spacebar no puede leer sin Acceso total al disco."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diğer her şey: /Library içindeki sistem genelindeki uygulama destek dosyaları, geçici dosyalar ve günlükler, Spotlight dizini, anlık görüntüler ve Spacebar'ın Tam Disk Erişimi olmadan okuyamadığı klasörler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything happens on your Mac. No account, no analytics. The only network use is checking for updates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
